defendants are children of Kirimudiyanse. At the beginning of the trial, the parties have recorded eight admissions. 
Those admissions are reproduced below. ....Page 77 01. බෙදීමට අබේක්ෂිතබමම නඩුවට අදාල ඉඞමගාමිනී ජයසිංහ මිනිනබදාරු තැන 
