KadawathaKankanamalage Tilak Dewapriya No.416, Dewala Road, Depanama, Pannipitiya Substituted -Plaintiff- Respondent 
-Vs￾1. (a) A.A. Deyawathi Perera 413, Depanama, Pannipitiya. 2 | C . A . R I I 3 5 2 0 2 3 – J u d g m e n t – J u s t 
